From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AltarsCN <337293323+Altars3668@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 11:56:57 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] include: Add wscapi.h and iwscapi.idl.

The Windows Security Center API: the providers and their health with the
exported functions, and the product list with its products.  Enum
values and GUIDs as in the Windows SDK; the interfaces are local, as
wscapi.dll implements them in process.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/include/Makefile.in b/include/Makefile.in
index bcfad0c30aa..e06daf6dd0d 100644
--- a/include/Makefile.in
+++ b/include/Makefile.in
@@ -423,6 +423,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	iptypes.h \
 	isguids.h \
 	ivectorchangedeventargs.idl \
+	iwscapi.idl \
 	kbd.h \
 	knownfolders.h \
 	ks.h \
@@ -1234,6 +1235,7 @@ SOURCES = \
 	ws2ipdef.h \
 	ws2spi.h \
 	ws2tcpip.h \
+	wscapi.h \
 	wsdapi.h \
 	wsdbase.idl \
 	wsddisco.idl \
diff --git a/include/iwscapi.idl b/include/iwscapi.idl
new file mode 100644
index 00000000000..010ef2c430b
--- /dev/null
+++ b/include/iwscapi.idl
@@ -0,0 +1,140 @@
